    "description": "Work on GPS-OCX. Started on Database team, responsible for writing and maintaining DDL and DML for OCX Mission Database. Using BASH, PL/SQL, PERL and Python to generate tools for maintaining user accounts, mission data and tables.  Built automated install of multiple OCX databases for DEVOPS pipelines.  Moved to the EIM team and took over the automation of database install into AWS.  Learned  Chef, Run Deck and Jenkins tools automated install, configuration and load of database.  Currently support automated install of all configuration items of GPS-OCX in multiple labs.  Received TS clearance on 4/7/2022",
